# Riddles in the Dark: "Look at the top four cards of your library and separate them into a face-down pile and a face-up pile. An opponent chooses one of the piles. Put
# that pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard." (CR 700.3.) The top four are Lightning Bolt, Island, Counterspell and Plains. Bot1 makes the Bolt and the
# Island the face-down pile, the Counterspell and the Plains the face-up pile; Bot2, the opponent chosen as it resolves, takes the face-up pile for Bot1: the Counterspell
# and the Plains go to Bot1's hand (the pool was empty after the cast), the face-down Bolt and Island to its graveyard. The scenario where the face-down pile is
# taken is the control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Riddles in the Dark
Island
Island
Island
Lightning Bolt
Island
Counterspell
Plains
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Riddles in the Dark.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Island)
Bot1.ChoosePlayer(Bot2)
Bot2.Modes(Face-up pile)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Counterspell; Plains
Bot1.Graveyard = Riddles in the Dark; Island; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
